cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LorenzParameterEstimation.jl"
abstract: >
  A Julia package for parameter estimation in the Lorenz-63 chaotic
  dynamical system using Enzyme.jl automatic differentiation and modern
  gradient-based optimizers. Implements windowed trajectory-based loss
  with teacher forcing to handle chaotic divergence, supporting
  recovery of the parameters σ, ρ, and β from observed trajectories.
  Developed as part of a master thesis on gradient-based parameter
  estimation in chaotic systems.
authors:
